Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:21.23,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics")
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.79,0:00:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:01:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:06.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:41.89,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,TAMAGAMI
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Tamagami Number Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you seek the Dragon Ball?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Extend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:02:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He really is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a genius. He's already acclimated\Nto the weight of this world's air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What the heck is he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's…!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Now let's get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, come on! You can do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if that's the game…!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ka… Me…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha… Me…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I admit it! I submit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You can still fight, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point in continuing further.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.35,0:07:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's quite amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I get to take the Dragon Ball, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before that… we have our final battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen anything like this before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A final battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one's ever gotten this far before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am going to switch these cups around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:09:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you can guess which cup\Ncontains the Dragon Ball…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,the Ball is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Isn't that a little cheap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that whole battle for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It appears that this is still a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to guess, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There! Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can anyone guess that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I managed to keep up for a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come now! Where is the Dragon Ball?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?! Which cup is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not one of the cups. Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You tossed it away at the end, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're correct. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I like you. You're a fair fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful and good luck on the other two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good going, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it!\NYou actually beat the Tamagami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.18,0:12:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done, Goku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, that guy was pretty strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. We've obtained\Nthe Third Demon World Dragon Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't expect things\Nto go this smoothly.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even as a brat, he's that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.37,0:12:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep up the good work, Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Leave things to me, Arinsu-sama.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.80,0:12:48.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I should move on\Nto my main plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.19,0:13:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Let's get going.\N-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I still can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just how strong are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You even use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You transformed\Nand shot weird light from your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. I guess in a way\Nthat's magic, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starvin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.08,0:13:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How does his body even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we headed to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Second Demon World.\NWe're headed to Warp-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll fly between land and sea.\NWe don't want to be discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. The Gendarmerie won't be able\Nto use their radios for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone defeated the Tamagami\Nand obtained the Dragon Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.90,0:14:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rumors of a spikey-haired boy with a red\Nstick are going to spread like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.99,0:14:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gomah-sama, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:14:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That person in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I recognize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Arinsu! What in the world is\NArinsu doing there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it appears that Arinsu already\Nknew about Majin Buu at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The previous Supreme Demon King Dabura\Nprobably told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:40.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what is she up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Marba, how goes it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:17:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The fragment of Majin Buu that you brought\Nreally brings the flavor together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I took a giant risk to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.81,0:17:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it should be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This had better work this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The last Majin couldn't even beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We won't know until it's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We added the essence of Majin Buu.\NIt should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Should be"? I thought you were\Nthe witch who created Majin Buu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?\NIt was the wizard Bibidi who created Buu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All he did was come to you\Nand ask you to make Buu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bibidi never had that sort of ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was Majin Buu who threw\Nthe Demon Realm into utter chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The other members of my race left to the\Noutside world, and some were even killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.\NI won't tell anyone that you made him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That thing was just a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Regardless, you could hardly\Ncall him a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was incredibly powerful, but couldn't\Nbe controlled and went on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I may be a genius scientist,\Nbut even I can't make a Majin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.54,0:18:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've focused on controllability.\NIt should work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:19:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, you'll need to\Ndrop some saliva in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By including your essence, you can share\Ninformation without having to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.23,0:19:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and will make it easier to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it works,\NI'm expecting quite the reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I become Supreme Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gomah may not look like much,\Nbut he's quite powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:42.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. If things go wrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll use the Dragon Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Dragon Balls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you planning on\Nusing the Dragon Balls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have other pawns in play
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.53,0:20:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and have already obtained one of them.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. This is Hybis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's me! King Kadan!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up? You seem excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey! We just heard that Goku-san\Nbeat the Tamagami and got the Dragon Ball!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We just got the news\Nand everyone's been celebrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.63,0:21:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I see… And?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to go after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're heading back to Warp-sama,\Nso meet up with them there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How soon will they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They stole a Gendarmerie plane\Nso they'll be there in a couple of days!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You can spend the night in a hotel!\NI'll call you later!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A hotel? Can I drink wine?\NMud-colored wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sure! Treat everyone to a feast!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're paying for it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Of course! Use the money I gave you!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hooray! We get to stay in a hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What sort of place? Is it five stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do we get to eat all sorts of good food?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mud-colored wine's yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. I wonder how it tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It tastes like mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:21:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly,\Nthey managed to get a Dragon Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.65,0:22:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey. Does the demon world\Nhave Dragon Balls, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.70,0:22:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? "Too"? Earth has Dragon Balls, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're not even a king but you act\Nso arrogant, so I ignored you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me more…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.73,0:22:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.37,0:22:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:23:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.15,0:23:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.77,0:23:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.28,0:23:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:45.54,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,THIEVES
